  "description": "A man injured from a fall after being shocked attempting to change a lightbulb was medevaced by South Texas air and boat crews 20 miles off Port Aransas, Texas, Thursday, July 24, 2014. An Air Station Corpus Christi MH-65 Dolphin crew hoisted the man with the assistance of a Station Port Aransas response boat crew and he was taken to Spohn Memorial Hospital in Corpus Christi. U.S. Coast Guard video by Air Station Corpus Christi",
